This is the square. Every runv.club member can put things here and
everyone can read them. Leave notes, share a script, start a project
with other people in a directory of its own.

- Nobody can delete or change your files but you. `ls -l` shows who
  wrote what.
- What you put here counts toward your disk quota.
- There are no backups of the square.
- The rules apply here like anywhere else.
- Don't run something from here before you've read it.
